mimic

This crate runs the Sopro v2 turbo text-to-speech weights by Samuel Vitorino
(https://github.com/samuel-vitorino/sopro, Apache License 2.0). The weights
are loaded unmodified and are not distributed with this crate.

The implementation here was written against the upstream reference
implementation (sopro 2.2.0, Python and JavaScript, Apache License 2.0) so
that every stage matches it numerically: the model architecture, text
normalization and splitting, tokenization, reference audio preparation and
output finishing follow what the reference computes.

